@startuml
 title Resumefolio - Decision status lifecycle
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  FontColor #17324D
}
state "Proposed" as Proposed
state "Accepted" as Accepted #DCFCE7
state "Rejected" as Rejected #FEE2E2
state "Superseded" as Superseded #EDE9FE
[*] --> Proposed : record a significant choice
Proposed --> Accepted : owner accepts stated scope
Proposed --> Rejected : owner rejects; retain reason
Accepted --> Superseded : another identified decision replaces it\nrecord rationale and replacement link
legend bottom
An ID stays attached to its original decision; never reuse or renumber it.
Confirmed arrangements retain their original source wording.
This diagram does not change the status of existing records.
endlegend
@enduml
